{"id":"018fa20c0b434cddefd1652bfc23c3263f11f2bf","url":"https://www.leiphone.com/category/ai/1krGNVOmEZUQgc9w.html","title":"苏神复盘 Kimi K3：896 个专家背后，藏着哪些关键技术取舍？ | 雷峰网","site_name":"TopHub","source":"Readhub · AI","byline":null,"excerpt":"从异常激活到专家拥堵，拆解超大模型训练难点。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n                                                <!-- 123 -->\n                        \n                        \n                                                \n                        <!-- AI影响因子 -->\n                        <!-- xhBPeYDbNuuRZkwy -->\n                                                <!-- AI影响因子 -->\n                        <!-- 正文内容 -->\n                        <section data-mpa-action-id=\"mmiwq6ij1i3r\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img alt=\"苏神复盘 Kimi K3：896 个专家背后，藏着哪些关键技术取舍？\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/XqAicMdcoiafPzkkptkDBicpyuRJQHdcV35rwlPfozoj8miawdppcqKDYBjh411bNC0QJ0LX1Gy7UuN7GcJDheu4YuH2hggWo8SK4M6CDs8qnn4/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"546\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"307\" data-imgfileid=\"100257388\" data-ratio=\"0.55\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260806/6a748fc003c9c.jpg\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1000\" src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260806/6a748fc003c9c.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90\"></section><section data-pm-slice=\"5 10 []\" data-mpa-action-id=\"mmix4tgk1t7p\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-data-temp-type=\"image\" mpa-data-temp-power-by=\"yiban.io\" data-mpa-template=\"t\" data-mid=\"\"><section><section><span><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mmix6wyl1l05\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">从异常激活到专家拥堵，拆解超大模型训练难点。</span></span></span></span></section><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mqgbkegzw9n\"></span><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mpmlbwxl8oz\"></span><span data-lark-record-data=\"{&quot;rootId&quot;:&quot;FdZeduLh9ohPKcxr1VD